3849f6bff5d8.600x338.jpg?t=1776539290"},{"id":11,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1255020/ss_a87cf5fb11cd8c4787bba4480e6bef638d75f775.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776539290","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1255020/ss_a87cf5fb11cd8c4787bba4480e6bef638d75f775.600x338.jpg?t=1776539290"},{"id":12,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1255020/ss_caa87250b214758cfc23a10c566c22b3871728bd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776539290","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1255020/ss_caa87250b214758cfc23a10c566c22b3871728bd.600x338.jpg?t=1776539290"}],"short_description":"Become a castle building, turnip farming, dungeon explorer in this silly blend of RTS and turn-based strategy. Expand your Kingdom, survive the night, and challenge bosses to upgrade your pieces in a world where pigs fly, trees fight back, and the rules of chess are completely reimagined.","steam_appid":1255020,"support_info":{"email":"inbox@iteration-games.com","url":"https://iteration-games.com/"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}